{"seq":3,"slug":"server-state-vs-client-state","title":"服务端状态与客户端状态分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/server-state-vs-client-state","wordCount":1154,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务端状态与客户端状态分离\">服务端状态与客户端状态分离</h1><p>前端应用中存在两种本质不同的状态：<strong>服务端状态</strong>——数据的权威来源在服务端，前端持有的只是一份可能过时的快照；<strong>客户端状态</strong>——数据完全由前端生成和拥有，服务端不知道也不关心。混淆这两种状态是大型前端应用架构腐化的首要原因——一旦将服务端数据塞入客户端 store（如 Redux slice），你就不得不手动处理缓存、过期、同步等本属于数据请求层的复杂性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>所有权分野</strong>：服务端状态是多客户端共享的、会过时的远程数据；客户端状态是当前用户独占的、永远最新的本地数据——两者需要不同的管理机制</li>\n<li><strong>工具分治</strong>：服务端状态交给 TanStack Query/SWR/RTK Query（自动缓存、去重、同步），客户端状态交给 useState/Zustand/Jotai（轻量、即时）</li>\n<li><strong>派生状态模式</strong>：服务端数据 + 客户端筛选条件 = 渲染期计算的派生值——不需要额外的 store 层，用 <code>select</code> 或 <code>useMemo</code> 即可</li>\n<li><strong>URL 作为状态源</strong>：可共享的客户端状态（筛选、排序、分页）放入 URL 而非内存——支持书签、分享和前进后退</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"两种状态的本质区别\">两种状态的本质区别</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>服务端状态</th>\n<th>客户端状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权威来源</td>\n<td>服务端数据库</td>\n<td>前端运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有权</td>\n<td>多客户端共享</td>\n<td>当前用户独占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期性</td>\n<td>会过时（其他客户端可能已修改）</td>\n<td>永远是最新的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久性</td>\n<td>跨会话存在（服务端存储）</td>\n<td>页面刷新即丢失（除非持久化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步需求</td>\n<td>需要与服务端保持最终一致</td>\n<td>无需同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型例子</td>\n<td>用户资料、商品列表、评论</td>\n<td>模态框开关、筛选条件、拖拽位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 服务端状态&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A[用户数据]&#10;        B[商品列表]&#10;        C[评论]&#10;        D[通知]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 客户端状态&#10;        direction TB&#10;        E[UI 开关]&#10;        F[表单草稿]&#10;        G[筛选排序]&#10;        H[滚动位置]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    I[TanStack Query / SWR / RTK Query] --&gt; A&#10;    I --&gt; B&#10;    I --&gt; C&#10;    I --&gt; D&#10;&#10;    J[Zustand / Jotai / Redux Slice / useState] --&gt; E&#10;    J --&gt; F&#10;    J --&gt; G&#10;    J --&gt; H\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 服务端状态\n        direction TB\n        A[用户数据]\n        B[商品列表]\n        C[评论]\n        D[通知]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 客户端状态\n        direction TB\n        E[UI 开关]\n        F[表单草稿]\n        G[筛选排序]\n        H[滚动位置]\n    end\n\n    I[TanStack Query / SWR / RTK Query] --&gt; A\n    I --&gt; B\n    I --&gt; C\n    I --&gt; D\n\n    J[Zustand / Jotai / Redux Slice / useState] --&gt; E\n    J --&gt; F\n    J --&gt; G\n    J --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"为什么要分离\">为什么要分离</h2><p>将服务端状态放入客户端 store 的代价远超收益：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 反模式：在 Redux slice 中手动管理服务端数据&#10;const usersSlice = createSlice({&#10;  name: &#39;users&#39;,&#10;  initialState: { data: [], loading: false, error: null },&#10;  reducers: {},&#10;  extraReducers: (builder) =&gt; {&#10;    builder&#10;      .addCase(fetchUsers.pending, (state) =&gt; {&#10;        state.loading = true;&#10;      })&#10;      .addCase(fetchUsers.fulfilled, (state, action) =&gt; {&#10;        state.data = action.payload;&#10;        state.loading = false;&#10;      })&#10;      .addCase(fetchUsers.rejected, (state, action) =&gt; {&#10;        state.error = action.error.message;&#10;        state.loading = false;&#10;      });&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;// 还需要：缓存策略、过期检测、后台刷新、请求去重、乐观更新、&#10;// 错误重试、分页管理、无限滚动……全部手写\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反模式：在 Redux slice 中手动管理服务端数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> usersSlice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSlice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialState: { data: [], loading: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reducers: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  extraReducers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fetchUsers.pending, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.loading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fetchUsers.fulfilled, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action.payload;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.loading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fetchUsers.rejected, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action.error.message;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.loading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 还需要：缓存策略、过期检测、后台刷新、请求去重、乐观更新、</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误重试、分页管理、无限滚动……全部手写</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用专用数据请求库后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 正确：服务端状态交给 TanStack Query&#10;const {&#10;  data: users,&#10;  isPending,&#10;  error,&#10;} = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;],&#10;  queryFn: fetchUsers,&#10;  staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000,&#10;  // 缓存、去重、后台刷新、重试……全部自动化&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 客户端状态用最轻量的方案&#10;const [isModalOpen, setIsModalOpen] = useState(false);&#10;const [filters, setFilters] = useAtom(filtersAtom);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：服务端状态交给 TanStack Query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  isPending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryFn: fetchUsers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  staleTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 缓存、去重、后台刷新、重试……全部自动化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 客户端状态用最轻量的方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isModalOpen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setIsModalOpen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setFilters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useAtom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filtersAtom);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"灰色地带-派生状态与混合状态\">灰色地带：派生状态与混合状态</h2><p>有些状态不完全属于任一类别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>筛选后的列表</strong></td>\n<td>服务端数据 + 客户端筛选条件</td>\n<td><code>select</code> 或 <code>useMemo</code> 派生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>表单中的服务端数据</strong></td>\n<td>服务端初始值 → 客户端编辑</td>\n<td>加载后转为客户端状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>乐观更新中的数据</strong></td>\n<td>客户端预测 → 服务端确认</td>\n<td>数据请求库的 mutation 层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>URL 状态</strong></td>\n<td>浏览器 URL</td>\n<td>视为客户端状态的持久化形式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 派生状态：服务端数据 + 客户端筛选&#10;const { data: allProducts } = useQuery(productQueries.all());&#10;const [category, setCategory] = useState&lt;string&gt;(&#39;all&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 派生计算在渲染期完成——不需要额外的 store&#10;const filteredProducts = useMemo(&#10;  () =&gt; (category === &#39;all&#39; ? allProducts : allProducts?.filter((p) =&gt; p.category === category)),&#10;  [allProducts, category],&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 派生状态：服务端数据 + 客户端筛选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">allProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(productQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setCategory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005